# Interface Vision (Fantasy RPG Theme)

Sidequest Mail should feel like a tavern notice board — but work like Proton Mail.
The parchment textures are the skin, not the mechanics.
Everything below is aesthetic and optional; the core email flow (read, reply, file, delete) must always be instant.

---

## Layout Grid

| Screen       | RPG Concept              | Behavior                                                                 |
|:-------------|:-------------------------|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Inbox**    | The Notice Board         | Emails are pinned scrolls. Unread scrolls glow with a faint magic aura.  |
|              |                          | Opening one "unrolls" it — the magic fades.                              |
| **Folders**  | The Library              | Each folder is a bookshelf. Navigating there shows: *"Book Retrieved."*  |
| **Sent**     | The Carrier Pigeon       | You sent the letter. "Pigeon Flown" energy.                              |
| **Trash**    | The Bonfire              | Where old letters are burned. Dragging an email there burns it to ash.   |
|              |                          | Restoring it is "rewriting the scroll."                                  |
| **Drafts**   | The Scribe’s Desk        | Still being written. Ink spilled, quill resting.                         |

---

## Navigation Grid

| Key          | Action                   | Flavor Text                              |
|:-------------|:-------------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| **Arrow Keys** | Move focus between emails | Parchment rustle sound                 |
| **Spacebar**   | Open selected email      | *"Unrolling scroll..."*                  |
| **Enter**      | Reply while reading      | *"Drafting reply."*                      |
| **Drag & Drop** | Move between folders     | Pinning a new scroll animation           |

---

## Visual Design Grid

| Element        | Concept              | Description                                                                 |
|:---------------|:---------------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Sidebar**    | The Map              | Looks like an old map with parchment textures. Fonts look like hand-written script. |
| **Email Cards** | Scrolls              | Each email is a scroll with wax seal. Unread scrolls have a glowing seal.  |
| **Compose**    | The Scribe’s Desk    | A parchment background with inkwell accents. Subject line = Letter Title.  |
| **Stickers**   | Runes & Symbols      | Inserting a sticker adds a magical rune or symbol.                         |

---

## Micro-interactions Grid

| Action         | Sound / Effect       | Trigger Context                          |
|:---------------|:---------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| Reading        | Parchment rustle     | Like unrolling a scroll                  |
| Replying       | Quill scratch        | Like writing on parchment                |
| Deleting       | Fire crackle         | Like burning a letter                    |
| Searching      | Magic chime          | Like a spell being cast                  |
| Composing      | Quill scratch        | Like writing on parchment                |
| Loading        | Progress bar         | Fills like a mana bar                    |

> All sounds default to **off**, toggleable in Settings → Audio.
> Silent mode is the default for a reason: this is still an email client people use at work.

